+      - Web requires alt prop when src is provided, and emits a development warning when
+        it is missing. The warning fires only for a HUMAN-type avatar with src, absent alt,
+        and decorative=false:
+        - Agent type ignores src entirely (Req 5 AC 5), so it never warns.
+        - decorative=true is the official non-informative signal (aria-hidden), so it
+          never warns — alt text would never be announced.
